  "chunks": [
    {
      "document_id": "demo-account-help",
      "document_version": "bf147e210295b2f0b1a284123de8ca29e191fba6677fad813c22f94929260ff8",
      "chunk_id": "3754d03a7199f6225d9c880589585b58e7da2b1847765304d2b740026c77aa1b",
      "content_hash": "fab0130a0e01a5ae8fd9ee3607d9409b971fcb8ebb6281812b55ce4fd68b292d",
      "content": "这是自编 Demo 语料。平台提供 dev-user 与 demo-user-b 两个演示用户。选择身份后发起会话，演示身份用于本地测试，不是真实生产登录。",
      "line_start": 5,
      "line_end": 5
    },
    {
      "document_id": "demo-order-query",
      "document_version": "ea3b37db8161e2ff54a8f3ed374c68d7178f6bbb43eb124d0d040c94fb3c6521",
      "chunk_id": "4d1cd6ea2739bba7c74c1b6dd1b4b1c6ca248e3f3f3f3d2e93dc96d961f27330",
      "content_hash": "a372bf79b910a45338bf2633d361576193ccba6c97fafa6a045398cbde5aeaf5",
      "content": "这是自编 Demo 语料。查询订单时请提供订单编号。系统只返回当前演示用户拥有的模拟订单，不会展示其他用户的订单。",
      "line_start": 5,
      "line_end": 5
    },
    {
      "document_id": "demo-refund-entry",
      "document_version": "b0857c16ef52a28cc7f2ec194afc25320c583184a02df8eebcd5b7b8be997da8",
      "chunk_id": "ba4effada25bb2a4a4b7d630a4bd1f204029f80f708f27fad74e503b1379488e",
      "content_hash": "d4c6d004bb3faed0ed8cc9bc1ec4a0ea19cb9141722c318918317174b757d81d",
      "content": "这是自编 Demo 语料。需要模拟退款时，在聊天中明确提出退款并提供订单编号。系统检查订单归属和资格，建立模拟退款申请，等待本地审批。知识说明不会改变资格和金额规则。",
      "line_start": 5,
      "line_end": 5
    },
    {
      "document_id": "demo-approval-wait",
      "document_version": "66912f18e3c494c69010aac3d9173859f8a45dd129a3c3954adad904185e22bc",
      "chunk_id": "4f94ebca3f804fa83d154bdf2b0f916375241fef9ab910fe54f64f701eb2fbd6",
      "content_hash": "1a09e46dae8f9fcc385b0e2e26887825a28c5c53c2612f08611a24df57fa069d",
      "content": "这是自编 Demo 语料。模拟退款处于等待审批状态时，普通聊天不能批准退款。请由本地演示审批控制面处理原申请。审批通过后系统恢复原任务并重新核验，批准不代表任意调用都被放行。",
      "line_start": 5,
      "line_end": 5
    },
    {
      "document_id": "demo-stream-help",
      "document_version": "b159b7bb41b3c3e4148628c29ffac109242e31aaa6cc431d60e24ab6541e99f4",
      "chunk_id": "82d78fb5860f9f312532ba084f9d48274cdbdd1fd5dd51414da07deefaa0d59d",
      "content_hash": "cfcdbb0b9ce1a047a9012fc4f7c08009cb1673e655054370acee00295afd2a1c",
      "content": "这是自编 Demo 语料。聊天输出采用流式连接。关闭页面或断开连接只结束订阅，已受理的模拟业务任务仍由系统执行。请使用原任务状态查询入口核对结果，不要仅根据连接断开判断操作失败。",
      "line_start": 5,
      "line_end": 5
    },
    {
      "document_id": "demo-refund-safety",
      "document_version": "e8d83ff154d926b1914fa6ee05345f592f51c595c3946a885d91d99be0d4d411",
      "chunk_id": "6929b31406f1aa9ed1329e786c0aebb04bbb976fbe7edb8b1a33dcedb04b45c5",
      "content_hash": "52c160f68e155ccc136d695306f353d6c8d94d4239602a9e1982e3a821955646",
      "content": "这是自编 Demo 语料。此项目不连接真实支付机构，退款仅改变本地模拟业务数据。相同退款操作采用稳定操作编号防止重复副作用；结果未知时先核对原操作，不盲目再次退款。",
      "line_start": 5,
      "line_end": 5
    },
    {
      "document_id": "task132-distractor-01",
      "document_version": "577904a228546c9d51f5415f6a4ce00a6e6988207a155e09ca842f3056ab000d",
      "chunk_id": "cfdd682d0d83cf3e12a338f67c22e58d3ab02476b4db2710b1c6829c6b748ea0",
      "content_hash": "0b56cf1c799b2b7ace6c46e64123d199ea934e2d3436900f9b6f802c5b2eb18f",
      "content": "演示会话在本地测试环境中创建，调用方可以查看会话状态和已受理的任务记录。",
      "line_start": 5,
      "line_end": 5
    },
    {
      "document_id": "task132-distractor-02",
      "document_version": "8d13658e5fe4d3917625d7452a2b8fa036678d92052d1234801bc90f05788cdd",
      "chunk_id": "f8ba6697318be00f56f488c6bcfc54807389c00dcaaa994f09f7965dd3a485c7",
      "content_hash": "3624360d10b7e16c1d3b0dd9a4627fd7a1bd79a35de173ae28426fcb811201ac",
      "content": "开始演示前请检查当前选择的演示身份，切换身份会影响后续请求所使用的上下文。",
      "line_start": 5,
      "line_end": 5
    },
    {
      "document_id": "task132-distractor-03",
      "document_version": "e46814a36ecb2425690ef7f12a371d9306fb0cfab8c4be8f29986062e871ecd6",
      "chunk_id": "b3fd0191428a93f0907af86c85c032d19792a652cbff0f130209bddbc14d9662",
      "content_hash": "768e899d5b4f6108173182fdbd4dbe83cb9823ea504ec0b50d37201319eb6198",
      "content": "订单列表展示模拟数据，可通过页面检查订单状态、创建时间和关联的演示会话。",
      "line_start": 5,
      "line_end": 5
    },
    {
      "document_id": "task132-distractor-04",
      "document_version": "c09ab8fe07b3ad3a44a4ef999d0f750aedcdc10ea94a25c09540db7fbb2d01e3",
      "chunk_id": "5b9e48750f06e7a638d751084da9aac5e366e79bd53762b7f9b488d29eeae26d",
      "content_hash": "9ef4c8be96c04a02a4d49b9fdd1f24437feb470e0f63589e72328d697c852b6d",
      "content": "订单详情页面提供当前模拟订单的状态信息，页面展示的记录来自演示数据。",
      "line_start": 5,
      "line_end": 5
    },
    {
      "document_id": "task132-distractor-05",
      "document_version": "40e88f078da202e29dd97658ca386ae7c422d8985eb87b4a7ff15d0cbdf095de",
      "chunk_id": "0f56a9e0dac911910a74727f68379b4562bb6ff3e95e727a86fdad0e567d7d31",
      "content_hash": "ba06503241d9d515e211a13a88d08f8bef0f83429a7c201433d74ae9d65896cf",
      "content": "流式页面逐步显示系统产生的消息，浏览器页面可以重新打开以查看界面。",
      "line_start": 5,
      "line_end": 5
    },
    {
      "document_id": "task132-distractor-06",
      "document_version": "f9190f448b420210cd1b4c0327a7a0395c649464a783b212cad6b5c0cf0deb3a",
      "chunk_id": "3d839cb616102b1373251cc9ec24008fefed3ef0cc4db151774ac2d19f7200f7",
      "content_hash": "cce2aef7aa7be22504edc9942e2a3d5d3295c17b4fe770f0e1de3539198505f6",
      "content": "会话记录用于回顾演示过程，显示消息的时间和处理阶段。",
      "line_start": 5,
      "line_end": 5
    },
    {
      "document_id": "task132-distractor-07",
      "document_version": "c82d56dfa243bc39c4ec39d7e401dc1970de5de44877e9ca727775e39704ab85",
      "chunk_id": "1aa980a483dbfa32c723005df9786e0eced2479c3898fe43a61e2890c1c9030d",
      "content_hash": "0a898fb2b769554d410871adc59c0c0d2142927c6f6c2d2cc5b25ef93c13963e",
      "content": "模拟退款记录显示申请建立时间、处理状态和关联的演示订单。",
      "line_start": 5,
      "line_end": 5
    },
    {
      "document_id": "task132-distractor-08",
      "document_version": "ab7d7e555b1f19d463c8c9cc68b0e96a0b480bc5ca358bc819834675be6d12d8",
      "chunk_id": "ce85f25c161f53e1abadbc5939068dcd615f75437ce42cb4a9b94e5067d933a5",
      "content_hash": "acbc25c6f76a7f9b15901590af002346ec4238ca9e1e2fa675662a2fce5b2566",
      "content": "售后页面提供模拟申请列表，可按状态查看已有的申请记录。",
      "line_start": 5,
      "line_end": 5
    },
    {
      "document_id": "task132-distractor-09",
      "document_version": "b82659d88a13f2400f7e91087eb55eea8419aaeeaac17aa575ecdb8083813bca",
      "chunk_id": "7738a3cf0a54625cf91829b912fc5ee4d50ad4441c54259cedd2fcdc13b791af",
      "content_hash": "7085db363fa5046d22560de46bde7e9d87ad873a765e3d80977ab563a9fc1c12",
      "content": "审批界面展示等待处理的模拟申请及其处理状态，处理记录用于演示审计。",
      "line_start": 5,
      "line_end": 5
    },
    {
      "document_id": "task132-distractor-10",
      "document_version": "8a70f3082030a568fc78ebe85b7db066d28dbcfa8801ee92d129f53ba03cd84a",
